\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Dewey Scholes is a marketplace and business operations platform for independent Certified Shorthand Reporters (CSRs) in California.\
The original vision included job posting, matching, scheduling, messaging, contracting, invoicing, payments, and workflow management.\
This revised MVP intentionally narrows scope to validate demand with the smallest possible product that still delivers meaningful value to both sides of the marketplace.\
